<title>UK: CLF Hypothekenbank sets 200 mln mark Jan 2004 FRN.</title>
<headline>CLF Hypothekenbank sets 200 mln mark Jan 2004 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CLF HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    02.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE   *07.NOV.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  100.13    FULL FEES  20 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*SHORT FIRST COUPON OF 2ML LIBOR FLAT PAYABLE ON</p>
<p>		01.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
